The remarks by a spokesman for the Royal Government of Cambodia came as the European Parliament is scheduled to convene on September 13, 2018. The meeting will also discuss human rights, democracy and the rule of law. Some members of the European Parliament are also attempting to raise the agenda, asking the European Parliament to approve a proposal to the United Nations to withdraw Cambodia's seat.
