Mr. Phay Siphan further stated that Cambodia is an independent, sovereign state and a full member of this intergovernmental organization called the United Nations. The Royal Government of Samdech Techo Prime Minister was formed by the will of the people in a liberal, multi-party democracy and not through the canon.
He added that in this regard, at least some friendly nations in the UN Security Council, as well as full members of the United Nations, also sent congratulatory letters to Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen, Director. The Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia, with respect to the choice of the Cambodian people, has the exclusive right to take responsibility for their own destiny, as enshrined and guaranteed by the United Nations Charter.
Duterte claims some former military officials are plotting to assassinate him
MANILA (Reuters) - Philippine President Rodrigo Duterte has claimed he has enough evidence that a group of opposition politicians, including Maoist rebels and some former Philippine military officials, are plotting to oust him or assassinate him. This was released by Sputnik on Wednesday, September 12, 2018.
In a televised address on Tuesday, Duterte said: "Some have said that they are currently planning ... and if they can not achieve their goals through "No bomb attack, they will plot to kill me."
The 73-year-old Philippine president did not say whether any foreigners were involved in his assassination plot, saying only that he would present evidence soon. However, Duterte has repeatedly accused the CIA of killing him.
