(Kampong Thom): Major General Som Sun, Commander of Kampong Thom Military Operation Area and President of Kampong Thom Provincial Veterans Association, on the evening of September 12, 2018, continued to lead the working group of Kampong Thom Veterans Association. And bring some gifts of Samdech Techo Hun Sen to give to a war veteran who lives in Svay Kalab village, Kor Koh commune, Santuk district, Kampong Thom province.
