On that occasion, Major General Som Sun and the working group of the Cambodian Veterans Association of Kampong Thom Province brought a gift from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, President of the Cambodian Veterans Association, through Lt. Gen. Hun Manet, Deputy Secretary General of the Cambodian Veterans Association, to provide him with rice. 50 kg of noodles, 2 cans of fish sauce, 2 sticks of soy sauce and a budget of 100,000 riels.
It should be noted that in March 2017, the Committee of the Cambodian Veterans Association of Kampong Thom Province also built a house measuring 4 meters x 6 meters, which is a precious gift from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, President of the Cambodian Veterans Association for Provide him and his family accommodation already.
