The district inspector added that the group of suspects detained now, including fugitives, had carried out countless shocking acts in Phnom Penh in all 10 districts where the suspects had been active. At this time, his forces have arrested three of the two suspects out of nearly 10 accomplices.
He said that for the remaining factions, his forces were searching for and arresting all the suspects. The arrested suspects are currently being interrogated by the criminal force of the Por Senchey District Inspectorate to continue their search for the fugitives. Case
