(Kampong Cham): Police in Kampong Cham province continued to crack down on nine suspects involved in a drug case in Prey Chhor district and confiscated some exhibits.
Kampong Cham Provincial Police Commissioner, Major General Em Kosal, said that the operation was carried out on September 9, 2018 at Ta Ok village, Boeung Nay commune, Prey Chhor district, Kampong Cham province by Kampong Cham specialized forces in cooperation with Baray district, Kampong Thom province. Launched an operation to crack down on drug trafficking and illegal use of drugs by using provocative rules in 1 case and arrested 9 suspects.
