(Phnom Penh): After a series of successful health-focused activities, the Cambodian Pharmacists Association has decided to register AF3 World Cambodia as a full member and solemnly announced at the "Thank You AF3 World" ceremony. And officially inaugurated the company ”on the night of September 10, 2018 at Koh Pich.
The official inauguration of F3 World was held under the chairmanship of General Miech Sophanna, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Interior and Chairman of the Anti-Counterfeit Products Committee, and with the participation of Mr. Dato .... and Mrs., Mr. Vann Sopheano, CEO of AF3 World Cambodia, and she, as well as thousands of national and international guests from Malaysia, Vietnam and Laos.
On that occasion, Dr. Ley Sopheap, President of the Federation of Investors and President of the Cambodian Pharmaceutical Sellers Association, read out the decision on the registration of AF3 World Cambodia as a full member of the Cambodian Pharmacists Association.
Article 2 of this decision states that "AFWorld (Cambodia) Co., Ltd. must act in accordance with the laws, regulations and laws in force of the Kingdom of Cambodia and the statutes of the Cambodian Pharmacists Association. Ministry of Interior.
After presenting this decision, Dr. Ley Sopheap also presented the Certificate and Outstanding Person Award to Mr. Vann Sopheano, CEO of AF3 World Cambodia, who sacrificed his physical, mental, resource and financial resources. Contribute to the provision of health services to the people of Cambodia.
In addition, the Cambodian Pharmaceutical Sellers Association often calls for and fully encourages traders, pharmacy owners, clinics, traders, manufacturers, craftsmen and citizens to trade and use only medicines and health products that are in accordance with the law. Proper registration, correct production dates, and clear sources are also needed to make a significant contribution to improving the health sector in Cambodia.
Apparently, the import of health products of AFF World is also contributing to the well-being of the people of Cambodia, because these products are very popular in many countries around the world. . It is a kind of medicine to treat health and enhance beauty, according to Mr. Vann Sopheano, CEO of AF3 World Cambodia.
