Two more concrete roads provided to Koh Thom residents after CPP overwhelming support
(Kandal): More concrete roads in Koh Thom district have been built in recent weeks by the Koh Thom District Strengthening Committee, led by Sun Chanthol, after the CPP. Received overwhelming support in the event of the National Assembly election on July 29, 2018.
On the morning of Saturday, September 08, 2018, two more concrete roads, 1,100 meters long, passed through the village of Chheu Khmao commune, Koh Thom district, Kandal province by Mr. Sun Chanthol and the working group of Koh Thom District Open the construction site for the people. According to the road construction budget team, this is the direct budget of the working group, not the national budget or the commune development fund.
Roads are considered as an important economic artery, connecting and transporting all products to all directions to support economic growth, family and society. As for the concrete road through the village of the people, it also plays an important role for the people, both in their daily commute and in the transportation of agricultural products.
Residents on both sides of the new concrete road said that their village had never had a concrete road in front of their house before, making it very difficult to travel, especially when it was raining and muddy. . After getting the concrete road, the people showed smiles, highlighting everyone's happiness.
With pleasure, they also commended the team of Koh Thom District Local Strengthening Committee for building the concrete road immediately as promised during the election campaign.
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol said that the CPP never promised the wind, that is, before the election, what to do after the election is for the people immediately.
In addition to the well-paved national roads, there are historical bridges across the Bassac River, which make it easier for people to travel. Interconnected cells also make it easier for people to travel.
According to the Koh Thom district report, through a task force led by Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, more than 40 kilometers of concrete roads have been built for the people of Koh Thom district, 20 bridges have been built and paved roads have been paved. And nearly 40 kilometers of dirt roads.
Please note that in addition to opening the construction site for concrete roads for the people, this morning, Mr. Sun Chanthol and his team also rode a bicycle to thank the people in some communes in Koh Thom district for the respect of love. People voted for the Cambodian People's Party and Samdech Techo Hun Sen and voted overwhelmingly.
In addition to thanking Mr. Sun Chanthol, he also organized a solidarity meal, packed lotus leaves with the people and sang songs, danced and entertained the people, creating a more friendly atmosphere and bringing more fun to the people who voted. Also.
In front of the people, Mr. Sun Chanthol and his team are also committed to continue to work hard to build, develop and serve the people twice as hard in Koh Thom district as a real public servant in accordance with the recommendations of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of the Kingdom. Cambodia "Officials are the servants of the people, not the masters of the people."
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol also instructed the people to provide information to the team in case they encounter difficulties in daily life and to actively cooperate in the construction of concrete roads to make this road construction smooth and fast. And.
