1: Vision and Mission of ASEAN Napoleon. The vision is all about maintaining local security. The mission aims to prevent and suppress all types of transnational crime through close communication and cooperation in a vibrant and innovative police force.
2: Solutions for the ASEAN Police Forensic Science Network for storing disaster victim identification data and location research.
4: Guidelines for organizing the ASEAN Napole Conference.
6: The ASEAN Annual Contribution Budget Proposal of the ASEAN Napol Secretariat for 2019 amounting to US $ 19,000.
10. Amendments to the guidelines for accepting observers and dialogue partners with ASEAN Napol.
