(Phnom Penh): Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly, on September 7, delivered a message of thanks to His Majesty the King of Cambodia, His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni and His Majesty Queen Norodom Monineath Sihanouk. Both of them sent a congratulatory message to Samdech Heng Samrin on the occasion that Samdech was elected by the National Assembly as the President of the National Assembly for the sixth term.
Please read Samdech Heng Samrin's message expressing his gratitude as follows: Samdech Techo Hun Sen's virtues lead to respect and admiration from the public
(Phnom Penh): In the first session of the Council of Ministers of the 6th legislature of the National Assembly, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, presented many major reasons why Samdech decided not to change ministers in the 28 ministries in the new term. This. Showing this reason in response to some doubts and criticism surrounding the non-change of the composition of the Minister.
To the members of the new Royal Government, as well as live broadcasts through various media, Samdech Techo Hun Sen explained that the effectiveness of the reform does not depend on the change of ministers, on the contrary, the effectiveness of the reform is Depends on the efficiency of the hard work of national servants and the people. He added that reform by changing people is like committing suicide.
The new Prime Minister of the Royal Government of Cambodia, who has been dubbed a "strong man", said that the implementation of this policy of change of people has caused some political parties to fail.
In addition to the above reasons, Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that the success of the election with the overwhelming support of the people in this mandate did not come from Samdech alone, but from the contribution of all cells of Cambodian People's Party.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen recalled that he used to work with only five people, but now the number has increased to hundreds because he adhered to the policy of "keep the old strength, increase the new force." This policy also helped Samdech to win all the battles.
After listening to these main reasons, the officials in both the Council of Ministers and the spectators on the live media broadcast were very respectful and admired for Samdech Techo Hun's virtuous and wise spirit. Sen.
What made Keang Seng most satisfied was the policy of "keeping the old strength, increasing the new strength." He said that this policy is the most pure and correct politics, which led to Samdech Techo's great success in leading both the party and the country. "I, on behalf of the people who love peace, fully support this just strategy with respect and love," he said.
Oknha Pha Sok, Dr. Keang Seng expressed his belief that the Cambodian nation under the leadership of a leader full of compassion, virtue and piety in the new mandate will continue to make the Cambodian nation continue to grow stronger and more prosperous, and the Cambodian people will The more you get happiness, too.
In addition to Duke Pha Sok, Dr. Keang Seng, government officials and the Cambodian people also expressed admiration and admiration for the virtuous spirit of Brahma and the generosity of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, which led to Samdech's success in leading. Of Samdech as well.
