Mr. Nep Samuth said that the procedure of the Good Hospitality Competition in the first tourism sector has 5 stages, including:
* Phase 1: The Capital-Provincial Department of Tourism has selected qualified candidates to participate in the Good Hospitality Competition in the tourism sector in accordance with the guidelines on good hospitality in approximately 250 locations.
* Phase 4: After that, all the official candidates will be posted on the official website of the Ministry of Tourism and the Good Hospitality Website or the Good Hospitality App in the tourism sector to allow citizens and tourists to participate in the evaluation (Vote) on Serve with good hospitality until mid-October 2018.
Phase 5: The Ministry of Tourism will announce the winners of the first "Good Hospitality in Tourism" on November 1, 2018.
