(Phnom Penh): After announcing the composition of the Council of Ministers for the sixth mandate, the first Plenary Meeting of the Council of Ministers chaired by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, began at 8:30 am on September 7. This 2018. The meeting took place in the Council of Ministers on the first floor of the Peace Palace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if reform only changes people, it is not different from suicide, Samdech stressed that reform is not only about changing people, but also about the content of work and efficiency.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in politics, only by exchanging people, that political party will die and that leader will die alone
* The new Prime Minister stated that Samdech started working from 5 people to millions due to the policy of keeping the old and increasing the new.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the success for this mandate is not because of Samdech alone, but because of the unity of the members of the CPP as a whole.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that Samdech is not surprised for those who do not vote for the CPP, because even Buddhism and other religions do not have all the people believe.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that if the CPP wins and has to abandon some ministers is the most virtuous thing.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech does not need to win a single battle, but must win every war through the policy of maintaining the old forces and increasing the new forces.
* The Prime Minister added that the policy of maintaining the old forces, increasing the new forces, and that is why it is not easy for people who came to stay with the Samdech to leave.
* The Prime Minister said that it is necessary to keep the old minister and put the children to work with him.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that during this Pchum season, Samdech will support all officials and retirees 50,000 Riels, which will cost a total of about 30 billion Riels, equivalent to 7 million US dollars.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that although the capacity has its limits, but the sincerity and efforts to serve the people have no limits, there are no obstacles that we can not overcome.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says people are waiting for the Royal Government's response to their vote.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that we must not disappoint the people by our inaction because of our wrongdoings, if we do not do anything, please do not hurt the people by the wrongdoings of our officials.
