Three new commanders appointed by the King will be announced tomorrow afternoon.
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of National Defense, will preside over the appointment of three new commanders, including General Vong Pisen, General Hun Manet and General Ith Sarath. Royal Decree from the King at the request of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia.
