Mr. Mao Thora, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Commerce, stated that the Ministry of Commerce under the leadership of Minister Pan Sosak has worked hard to coordinate with relevant institutions to find solutions to problems for the Cambodian and international private sector with the Royal Government, such as supporting the organization. Business meetings as well as various trade fair events.
On that occasion, the Secretary of State also praised the Mien Pailin community for its efforts to unite as a community and contribute to improving the quality of Khmer agricultural products, geographically, and in which the community must jointly produce a large amount of longan fruit and quality. And hygiene in accordance with international market standards and requirements.
