(Phnom Penh): At 4:00 pm on September 6, 2018, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, together with the leaders and members of the new Royal Government, were sworn in at the Royal Palace in front of the King. Its position.
The composition of the Royal Government in the new mandate consists of one Prime Minister, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, 10 Deputy Prime Ministers, 17 Senior Ministers and 29 Ministers who have just been elected by the National Assembly this morning, September 6, 2018. This.
* We are determined to sacrifice our lives to protect both now and in the future: * Complete independence of the motherland of Cambodia, full national sovereignty * Legal territorial integrity in the land and sea borders Cambodia existed from 1963 to 1969 * National unity and did not allow any division or separatism.
* We are committed to maintaining neutrality and non-alignment for Cambodia, both now and in the future, and will not allow anyone who wants to interfere in the internal affairs of Cambodia or to order Cambodia's national and international policy. We do not serve foreign interests and do not harm the interests of the people, the nation and the motherland of Cambodia.
In resolving national and international issues, we will completely eliminate all forms of violence. However, the Kingdom of Cambodia reserves the right to bear arms and fight against foreign aggression in order to defend its homeland.
* We are committed to the current and future liberal democracies of parliamentary and multi-party regimes, as well as the strict respect for human rights as enshrined in the Universal Declaration of Human Rights. .
* We are determined to fight against all kinds of corruption, against social injustice, and to fight for national reconciliation, for national unity, for social peace and national peace, for the prosperity of the Cambodian people and for the glorious prosperity of the motherland of Cambodia. Respect and love of all of us.
