New Royal Government: New blood, old blood, create new energy to serve the cause of the nation, the motherland and the people of Cambodia!
(Phnom Penh): In just a few hours, the people of Cambodia and the whole world will know exactly who is in charge of the new National Assembly and the new Royal Government. Maintained top secret, no leaks at all.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that only four people knew about the composition of the new government of the sixth mandate. So far, the question remains in the minds of the people, and the strongest is the civil servants in the various ministries of the Royal Government, who are waiting to see if their ministers will continue to lead the same ministry or be transferred to a new ministry. Or have to retire or stay in parliament?
Which dignitaries will be trusted to lead institutions under the Royal Government? On the morning of September 6, 2018, the Secretariat will be opened by the election of the National Assembly and the Royal Government in accordance with Article 4 of the Constitution, after all 125 deputies have been validated and sworn in. On September 5, 2018.
The new Royal Government will consider the interests of the nation and its people even more to achieve the goal of making Cambodia a high middle-income country by 2030 and a high-income country by 2050 and to Maintain economic growth along with the well-being of the Cambodian people.
At the same time, in the sixth mandate, they must also be prepared that it is likely that Samdech Techo Hun Sen will also reshuffle the Council of Ministers if necessary to respond to the development of the situation and the needs of society, as Samdech did. Already in the fifth mandate by changing the composition of some ministers.
Second): Old blood, new blood for the cause of the motherland:
This reflects the proper leadership of the Royal Government as well as the active participation of party organizations and officials at all levels who have struggled to carry out their roles and responsibilities responsibly. In the face of recent developments in the regional and global situation and the rise of opposition groups and the outside world, the CPP-led government needs to step up and be ready at all times.
Old blood, new blood, create new energy and new beliefs on the old goal is to serve the cause of the nation, the motherland and the people of Cambodia!
(Phnom Penh): On September 05, 2018, all 125 (elected) elected representatives of the Cambodian People's Party, who received popular support from the people, attended the first session of the National Assembly for the 6th legislature under God. The high presidency of His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of Cambodia.
In addition to the 125 members of parliament, the first session was attended by ambassadors and ambassadors of 22 countries to Cambodia, as well as representatives of five major international organizations, including national guests. And many other internationals as well.
The situation of the opening of the first session of the National Assembly in the 6th legislature is good, while security and order are well organized both inside and outside the National Assembly. In particular, around the National Assembly, it is observed that there is no tension like in 2013. Many national and international journalists covered the important meeting.
In his opening remarks at the opening of the first session, His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni expressed his pleasure at the opening of this first session and congratulated all the new members of the National Assembly. The people have shown their will and trust through the last election.
The King also believes in the new National Assembly, which will continue to fulfill its duties to continue political, economic, social and cultural sustainability, to build a strong and prosperous Cambodia based on the rule of law, ensuring equal application of the law for all citizens. Figure. The Kingdom of Cambodia strongly believes that the Royal Government of Cambodia in this new mandate will continue to improve the lives of the people, develop and strengthen the social protection system.
After the Royal Speech to open the first session, the King took a souvenir photo with the candidate elected to the 6th legislature of the National Assembly and returned to the Royal Palace.
After the King's retirement to the Royal Palace on the morning of September 5, Samdech Heng Samrin, the senator (the oldest member) chaired the session and the National Assembly decided to validate it. All 125 deputies were elected and approved the internal regulations for the 6th legislature.
On the afternoon of September 5, 2018, at 2:30 AM, all 125 MPs from the Cambodian People's Party met at the National Assembly and left to attend the swearing-in ceremony in the presence of the King of Cambodia. His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni at the Royal Palace before starting to serve the nation and the people.
The swearing-in ceremony is to ensure that all MPs serve faithfully to the nation and the people, especially to ensure that the work of all MPs will not betray the interests of the nation and the people for the benefit of foreigners. That. The following are the full oaths that all members of the National Assembly will be recited by the King Father:
We are determined to fight against all kinds of corruption, against social injustice, and to fight for national reconciliation, for national unity, for social peace and national peace, for the prosperity of the Cambodian people and for maintaining the glorious prosperity of the motherland of Cambodia. Respect, reverence and love of all of us.
After the validation and swearing-in of the Royal Palace, that means that from now on, all 125 elected MPs will have full rights as MPs for the 6th National Assembly with special privileges for 5 years. And fulfill its duties fully on behalf of the MPs.
