Scientists are using new ways to absorb solar energy and produce oxygen ...
(London): The photosynthesis that plants and other organisms use to convert sunlight into energy and produce the oxygen needed for humans and animals on Earth has been processed by scientists into a method. A new one to take advantage of solar energy. This was quoted from the Chinese news agency Xinhua on Wednesday afternoon, September 5, 2018.
According to a new study, natural photosynthesis is less effective because it generates less energy for plants only, about one to two percent of what can potentially be converted and Stockable.
In contrast, artificial photosynthesis, which has been around for decades, relies on the use of expensive and dangerous catalysts, so this method is not yet widely used in industry.
For the above research, the scientists conducted a semi-artificial (semi-artificial) method that uses enzymes instead of catalysts to bypass the limits of artificial photosynthesis and get better results that can open Path for the development of solar technology. The contents of the swearing-in ceremony of the deputies will be made in the presence of the King this afternoon
