Mam Phalla, Director of the Department of Environment, said that after receiving the information about the encroachment on the flooded forest, which is a sanctuary for animals and fish, environmental officials immediately cooperated with the authorities to crack down on the encroachment. Investigate and arrest one person and build a case to be sent to court for legal judgment.
On Virak, deputy governor of Koh Kong province, said briefly that the suspects had been arrested and taken to court, and that the land they had seized had been confiscated as state property.
(Kampong Thom): Bright red rice fields on the east side of Tonle Sap Lake, in the late afternoon, the red light shines brightly from the west, the sound of cattle can be heard along the stream of Banteay Chas Ord, Kampong Pram village, Msakrang district. Stong, Kampong Thom province, the laughter of the farmers of Say Kang Rompong all over Veha.
