The King's speech was made on the occasion of his presidency at the opening ceremony of the first session of the National Assembly of the 6th legislature this morning, September 5, 2018, with the presence of the elected representatives. 125 people. The opening of the first session was also attended by ambassadors and ambassadors of various countries to Cambodia.
