Please be informed that after waiting for more than a month after the election, the new National Assembly appeared on Wednesday morning, September 5, 2018, and is the day to see the presence of both deputies. 125 from the Cambodian People's Party, which will serve the people as voters in the sixth mandate for 5 years.
As in previous mandates, in accordance with the Constitution of the Kingdom of Cambodia, the opening of the first session of the new legislature of the National Assembly on September 5 took place under the presidency of the King of Cambodia, His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni. In addition to the 125 members of the National Assembly, the opening of the first session was also attended by ambassadors and ambassadors of various countries to Cambodia.
According to the announcement of the National Assembly, the opening ceremony of the first session today started at 8 am. After the opening of the first session, the opening of the first session will begin its work under the chairmanship of Mr. Heng Samrin, Senator of the National Assembly to decide on the validity of the mandate of each member and the approval of the internal regulations of the National Assembly for the sixth term.
In the afternoon, all 125 lawmakers will enter the Royal Palace to be sworn in before the King of Cambodia before beginning their work.
Separately, for the next day, that is, on September 6, the National Assembly will hold the election of the National Assembly locomotives, including: Chairman, Vice-President of the National Assembly, Chairman of the Vice-Chairman of the National Assembly Expert Committee, and also give confidence to the locomotives of the new government.
