(Phnom Penh): Mr. Leang Phaly, Chairman of the Volunteer Medical Team, Mr. HUN Many, confirmed that the free check-ups and treatment for people in the capitals and provinces came from the love of real people and want to see People are healthy, young and old, and this volunteer work is done without any political affiliation.
This statement was made on September 2, 2018 on the occasion that Mr. Hun Many's team of 333 volunteer doctors led by Mr. Leng Phaly, Chief of Mr. Hun Many's volunteer doctors visited and treated They also brought free medical supplies to 4,635 people in Ang Neal pagoda, Svay Chap commune, Bor Seth district, Kampong Speu province, and distributed bread and water to them.
Mr. Leang Phaly said, "The examination and treatment of the people is a pure humanitarian spirit that reflects the love of the Cambodian people, and health issues are the foundation for success and work. "This volunteerism is done without any political affiliation."
He added that the free check-ups and treatment for the people came from a group of local and foreign doctors who cooperate with students at different universities to see you. All those people are only healthy.
At the same time, the people in Bor Seth district, Kampong Speu province also expressed their happiness when they saw a group of volunteer doctors, Mr. HUN Many, visited them for free and even near his house. They too.
Deu Sokhom, over 50 years old, with frequent headaches, dizziness and heartburn, expressed her true gratitude for the attention of the country's leaders, especially Mr. Hun Many, who organized the group. Work to check the health of people in rural areas like him.
Another resident of Chachep commune, Moeun Samkhan, expressed his unprecedented happiness. Mr. Samkhan has gastritis and every day this condition is kept in his stomach, thanks to the team of volunteer doctors who came down to treat him as well as other villagers.
Finally, the two residents of Bor Seth District, Kampong Speu Province expressed their gratitude to Mr. Hun Many for his generosity by sending a team of doctors to treat and give them free medicine. In addition, the two citizens also asked the head of the team of volunteer doctors, Mr. Leang Phaly, to come down to their district to treat as much as possible.
