* The Prime Minister stated that at the beginning of the fifth mandate, the Royal Government of Cambodia won a gold medal from the Asian Games by Miss Sorn Seavmey, and at the end of the mandate won two more gold medals. Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that this is the success of the Royal Government through the joint efforts of the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that on September 6, 2018, Samdech will become the Prime Minister of the sixth mandate.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked Mr. Hor Nambora, Ambassador to Indonesia for facilitating the Cambodian athletes and delegates to participate in the Asian Games in Indonesia.
* In addition to the Royal Government's bonus of 80 million Riels, Ms. Khan Chesa also received a stipend from Samdech $ 10,000. At the same time, the coach received a bonus of 80 million riels from the Royal Government and a direct allowance of Samdech $ 10,000.
* Salit Umet received a stipend from the Royal Government of 104 million Riels and a stipend from Samdech $ 13,000. The coach received 80 million riels from the Royal Government and 10,000 dollars from Samdech.
* Samdech Techo stated that the new mandate will examine the awarding of prizes to the winning athletes. But Samdech stressed that the prize money is one thing, but what is important is to bring honor to the nation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he did not hate the United States, but only those who sent troops to invade Cambodia.
