(Phnom Penh): Dr. Heng Bunkiet, Director of the Department of Medicine, Food and Medical Equipment and Cosmetics of the Ministry of Health, calls on food business owners in restaurants and cafeterias across the country to receive full training on good hygiene practices from the Ministry of Health. To contribute to reducing the rate of food accidents in Cambodia.
