(Ratanakkiri): Mr. Thong Savun, Governor of Ratanakkiri Province, asked for the understanding of the people who are the travelers to the problem of damaged roads not repaired due to rain for more than two months ago while The machinery of the Provincial Department of Public Works and Transport is ready to repair and build those damaged roads after the rain.
