The provincial governor also instructed the leaders of the provincial public works department to examine and study clearly about the project to build a red gravel road into a rubber road from the provincial town to Ta Veng district, making it of high quality and in accordance with technical standards. The road has been badly damaged by floods every day for almost three months.
