Most land fishing offenses in Kandeang district are all paid to Mr. Lim Sokret. In fact, in cracking down on the above-mentioned "B" crime, Mr. Lim Sokret's team on August 7, 2018 inspected the crime and summoned the "B" owner to demand money.
Fishermen in Pursat province's Kandeang district say that since Lim Sokret was appointed chief of the Kandeang Fisheries Administration commune, he has never cracked down on crime in good faith.
NEC urges stakeholders to continue to work together to ensure better results of annual voter registration and voter registration
(Phnom Penh): The National Election Committee (NEC) has requested stakeholders to continue to work together to ensure better annual voter registration and voter registration. This is according to the press release of the NEC on August 3, 2018.
According to a press release received by Fresh News on the afternoon of August 3, 2018, this is the request of Mr. Nuth Sokhom, Deputy Chairman of the NEC, which was made at the closing ceremony of the training of secretaries. Capital / Province Election of political parties and non-governmental organizations on the examination of the 2018 voter list on the afternoon of August 2, 2018.
Mr. Nuth Sokhom stated, "Sincerely yours, to the Capital and Provincial Secretariat for the Election, please pay attention to the computer experts as well as the maintenance and use of equipment." "Register to vote better."
According to Mr. Mok Dara, Deputy Secretary General of the NEC, the review of the 2018 voter list and voter registration aims to ensure that the voter list is complete, accurate and up-to-date through:
1: Extraction and deletion of voter names, including: * Those who died
* People who have been temporarily disenfranchised
* Those who have moved from one commune to another with proper and clear documents to be removed from the voter list.
2: Correction of names or voter data at the request of the person concerned with valid documents
3: Voter registration refers to:
* Khmer citizens who have the right to vote and have not previously registered to vote
Citizens who have just moved or relocated to a new commune / sangkat to register to vote in the commune / sangkat where they are to vote.
The Deputy Secretary-General said that after receiving the data on voter registration, the NEC will prepare the first voter list for complaints or objections, and at the end of resolving complaints, the NEC will validate. Official voter list for 2018. Nguon Sary's family would like to thank all the relatives and friends who were invited to the funeral.
