(Svay Rieng): Mr. Men Vibol, Governor of Svay Rieng Province and Chairman of the Red Cross Branch Committee of Svay Rieng Province, on the morning of September 3, 2018, led a working group to meet and distribute humanitarian donations to 255 Cambodian people. Family.
