9 Suspects Arrested in Drug Case in Kampong Cham City, Kampong Cham Province
(Kampong Cham): Nine male and female suspects were arrested by Kampong Cham Provincial Police in connection with a drug trafficking case on the evening of September 2, 2018 at Village 5, Sangkat Veal Vong, Kampong Cham City, Kampong Cham Province.
