Experts share experiences on investing in the financial sector in Cambodia
(Phnom Penh): In order to educate the general public about financial investment, Cambodian expert Mr. Cheng Daravuth, Chief Financial Officer of Golden FX Link, shared his experience and understanding on financial investment in Cambodia. To the public.
This knowledge sharing workshop was organized by Golden FX Link Capital in response to the growing domestic and international focus on financial investment, especially derivatives trading, which plays an important role. In promoting the economic sector.
Mr. Cheng Daravuth explained the current trends of the international financial markets and said that in this era, the financial business is operating and growing on the Internet and the derivatives market is gaining popularity due to the wide benefits. And the growth of technology.
"Simply put, investors have many options to develop trading strategies and can invest in the short, medium or long term in this volatile market," he said. At the same time, investors can protect their investment capital by using effective risk management methods that create a platform for increasing wealth and allow investors to trade with confidence and comfort.
It should be noted that this workshop contributes to Golden FX Link's efforts to provide financial literacy to move the derivatives market in Cambodia forward by providing strong resources and commitment from the company. The market is expected to continue to grow and meet international standards in the future.
