At the same time, Mr. Ley Sopheap also added that for those who do not understand and do not know how to complete the procedures for business registration, the Cambodian Pharmacists Association and the Cambodian Federation of Pharmaceuticals and Dentists also have a team to help. Facilitate all those traders as well.
