For companies / factories / enterprises wishing to participate, please send the names and CVs of their employees to the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training or the Garment Manufacturers Association of Cambodia to participate in the competition and apply from today. Second September until September 15, 2018 onwards.
Staff competition - Outstanding workers are organized for 5 positions: 1: Manager, 2: Supervisor or Senior Staff, 3: Team Leader, 4: Sewing or Office Staff, 5: General staff and workers (drivers, gardeners, cleaners ...). All winners will receive a Certificate of Outstanding Employee from the Ministry of Labor and Vocational Training with:
* First place winner will receive $ 300 and $ 200 voucher for training course at CGTI
* Second place winner receives $ 200 and $ 200 voucher for training course at CGTI
3rd place winner receives $ 100 and $ 200 voucher for CGTI training course
