"I am very proud to have partnered with Forte Insurance, one of the leading and most reliable companies in providing affordable insurance services to our customers," he said. On the other hand, all customers of KB Specialized Bank can pay monthly insurance instead of total insurance payment.
The CEO hopes that through this signing, it will be a mechanism to encourage customers and the public to have more confidence in KB Bank, because insurance is very important for customers when customers face problems. Risks such as car loss, collision or other accidental occurrence and Forte Forte will reimburse the customer.
Mr. Youk Chamroeunrith expressed his deep gratitude to KB Specialized Bank for choosing Forte Insurance as its car insurance partner, which shows the care and concern of customers.
"In response to the bank's trust in the company, I am committed to providing insurance services to KBB customers quickly and easily, ensuring that both institutions receive high support from customers," he said.
