Dentist Tith Hong Yeu, Director of Roomchang Dental Hospital, said that due to Cambodia's progress and political stability, the population in Phnom Penh is increasing day by day, which is the reason why Roomchang Dental Hospital decided to open a new branch. More.
Especially, for the past 22 years, Roomchang Dental Hospital has strived to provide high quality and professional dental services to national and international clients and will be recognized by the international standard ISO 9001: 2015. With a reputation as the best dentist in Cambodia.
In addition, the management and staff of Roomchang Dental Hospital would like to thank all of you, ladies and gentlemen and guardians of children who always love, support and choose Roomchang as a family dentist forever.
(Phnom Penh): The modern capital strategy that entrepreneurs in developed countries always think of is to use other people's money to expand their business.
According to business expert Sim Dara, the Cambodia Securities Exchange is a gateway for young business owners in modern capital strategy.
He said that in developed countries, business owners who want to start their own business, they always think of the stock market in their country first, because there is a place where traders can use other people's money to expand their business easily. .
On March 12, 2018, the Cambodia Securities Exchange and SUCCESSCO jointly signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MOU) to support the growth of Cambodian securities trading, or simply the Cambodian Stock Exchange.
According to Sim Dara, the purpose of the MOU between the two companies is to raise awareness of the importance of listing on the stock exchange to provide a framework for training entrepreneurs to better understand the benefits of listing. In the stock market and how to prepare to qualify to enter this market.
Please be informed that the purpose of this special night for leaders and business owners is as follows:
1: Increase relationships with leaders and many other business owners
2: Get good experiences from those who are running a business with a clear vision and a positive mindset.
3: Learn the knowledge and important tips from speakers who have successful experience in business and real life.
4: Find out about new projects or business ideas that are different and potential in the market.
5: Understand the main factors of a corporation that can receive investment or can be listed on the stock exchange in the future.
