The letter sent to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, received by Fresh News on the afternoon of August 31, 2018, stated that the Prime Minister of Sri Lanka stated, "I am very pleased, I would like to express my warm congratulations to Samdech Techo Hun Sen. "Appointed Prime Minister of the Kingdom of Cambodia."
Sri Lankan Prime Minister Ranil Wickremesinghe expressed his belief that under the rule of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the relationship between Sri Lanka and Cambodia, which has grown by sharing cultural ties, will be further strengthened. The return of the people of both countries.
