He also thanked the Royal Group Chairman Oknha for his generosity in donating the land, which is his personal property, to the Kantha Bopha Foundation of Cambodia and for promoting the fund, and especially through specialized banks. Wing (Cambodia) Limited facilitates free donations.
This generous gesture has been helping millions of Cambodian children. With the signing of this Memorandum of Understanding, he also encouraged the Kantha Bopha Working Group of Cambodia to strengthen cooperation with Wing Specialized Bank (Cambodia) Limited and other relevant partners in continuing to disseminate funds and facilitate mobilization. Donate more and more.
