However, four other political parties have not yet joined the Supreme Advisory Council, including: Our Motherland Party, 2: Local Democrat Party, 3: Alliance for Democracy and Fourth: The Khmer Rouge Party. Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth Holds a Meeting to Monitor the Progress and Evaluate the Implementation of the Public Financial Management Reform Program
(Phnom Penh): Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Senior Minister, Minister of Economy and Finance and Chairman of the Steering Committee for Public Financial Management Reform (CSEC), convened a meeting of the Financial Management Reform Commission. Public objects to discuss the progress report on the progress of the public financial management reform program for the first and second quarters of 2018.
This important meeting was held at the Ministry of Economy and Finance on August 28, 2018.
The meeting lasted throughout the morning, focusing on:
* Monitoring the progress and evaluation of the implementation of the implementation of the Public Financial Management Reform Program, Phase 3, first quarter and second quarter of 2018
* Monitoring the progress of the implementation of the EU Outcome Framework Mid-2018 and
* Implementation of the medium-term revenue collection strategy 2014-2018.
As a result, in the first and second quarters of 2018, the implementation of the third phase of the Public Financial Management Reform Program achieved the following:
* Part 1 "Budget reliability" still achieves good results with better revenue collection. As of the first half, the implementation of domestic revenue compared to the budget law (current revenue and local capital revenue) reached 53.60%, while the implementation of expenditures was in a position to achieve the target of 40%. The cash position can still be maintained essentially without new congested debt.
* Section 3 "Linking budgets to policies" has also made good progress. Program budgets are being implemented in all ministries, institutions and all capital-provincial administrations, while the implementation of program budgets is also running smoothly and leading to the implementation of performance information budget through the preparation of guidelines, program budgeting and planning. Budget strategies and other legal frameworks that support all of these processes.
* Section 4 "Preparation for the next step" and Section 5 "Support for the implementation of a successful and sustainable reform program" are in good condition and need to continue to receive more attention from all relevant units. .
In addition, the meeting also heard the results of the mid-2018 progress review of the implementation of the EU Outcome Framework, which reflected the progress of the implementation of the Framework, as well as the draft Outcome Framework for 2019-2020. .
For the progress of the implementation of the medium-term revenue collection strategy 2014-2018, four major principles have been implemented, including:
1: Strengthen the management of revenue collection to its full potential 2: No new types of taxes are created. 3: No increase in taxes and duties, except in the case of loss of income. 4: Ensure convenience, equity and justice.
