Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of meeting with more than 10,000 workers in Phnom Penh this morning, August 29
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on Wednesday, August 29, 2018, continued to hold talks with 14,799 workers. The other is from 6 factories in Por Sen Chey district. The meeting took place in Trapeang Thleung village, Sangkat Choam Chao, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that this evening, Samdech allowed the Indian Foreign Minister to pay a courtesy call and talk.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are 10 more meetings with workers and have been included in Samdech's work program. Samdech Techo affirmed that Samdech will continue to meet with such workers forever to achieve the implementation of the industrial policy 2015-2025.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen, on behalf of the President of the Cambodian People's Party, thanked the workers and people all over the country went to the polls to support the Cambodian People's Party, despite the obstruction of the group "sleep home win alone".
* Samdech Techo stated that the election of support for the Cambodian People's Party of workers and people across the country is a show of support for the peace of this country because they know that only the Cambodian People's Party Only one can stand up for the peace that exists in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is accompanying the Cambodian people to high-middle-income countries by 2030 and high-income countries by 2050.
* Samdech Techo, head of the Royal Government, stated that the salary increase must take into account other factors that may lead to the departure of the factory owner. Samdech Techo said that peace is a big thing, but competition in the labor market with other countries must also be considered, such as Bangladesh $ 67, Sri Lanka $ 67, India $ 67 to $ 140, Myanmar 108 Indo $ 107 to $ 260 ... .
In this sense, the Prime Minister wants to consider raising the wages of workers, not to think of demanding higher wages for non-profit factory owners and removing factories from Cambodia to other countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the first day of the Cabinet meeting for the new mandate on September 7, Samdech will deliver the opening message of the meeting, allowing live broadcast.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen greeted the workers as the well-being of Samdech and no leader of any country wants to lead the country to poverty.
* The head of the Royal Government emphasized that Samdech has led this country from a difficult situation with a population of 5 million to 16 million people today with a better life.
* The Prime Minister called on companies, factories, enterprises, non-wives to register with the National Social Security Fund so that employees can receive various benefits from the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that what he wanted was for the Sok San factory community, that is, factory owners and workers to know how to work together to create harmony in the factory, because the two sides could not be separated.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the reason why Samdech had to continue to visit the workers was because after the meeting with the workers, the boss, the administrative director, the division chief, there were no more illegal demonstrations.
* Samdech Techo, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, stated that the payment of wages for workers from 2019 will no longer be paid monthly, but will be paid once a week, once every two weeks.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on factory owners to improve the infrastructure in the factory, such as the provision of food and health services.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that during the Pchum and New Year seasons, public buses will be deployed on national roads to prevent the increase in bus fares of passenger companies.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are two types of pardons these days. Type 1: Type made a letter of request to Samdech, acknowledging his mistakes, such as Mr. Ou Sam An, Mr. Meach Sovannara and Mrs. Tep Vanny.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen requests the media, radio and television, to publish the apology letter of the released prisoners widely.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is a left-right politician. In this sense, Samdech Samdao to Sam Rainsy, who last week tried to incite Samdech not to release prisoners, but in the end, Samdech released all without following Sam Rainsy's incitement.
* Samdech Techo stated that those who are pardoned by the King do not need to pay compensation according to past lawsuits.
* The Prime Minister stated that for those who have been pardoned through the execution of their sentences, they must pay compensation of about 800 million riels. Samdech Techo said that if he did not pay, he would have to go back to prison. The prisoner who was released by the previous execution is Mr. Kem Sok.
* Samdech Techo stated that if the compensation is not paid according to this complaint, Samdech will send it back to prison.
* Samdech ordered the authorities to arrest the mastermind who announced the movement to prepare to receive Mr. Kem Sokha in Trapeang Phlong.
* Samdech Prime Minister announced that Samdech continues to sue Mr. Kem Sokha for treason.
* Samdech Techo stated that Samdech welcomes two other political parties that want to participate in the "Supreme Advisory Council" but do not follow the information, must write a letter to the Royal Government.
Letter to readers: Forgiveness is a virtue of Samdech Techo, not because of foreign pressure
(Phnom Penh): The Constitution of the Kingdom of Cambodia states that Buddhism is the religion of Samdech Techo, a patriarch who led the country on the basis of Buddhism and always adhered to the moral virtues of divine leadership. Buddhism is the royal and Brahma temple, compassion, mercy, giving and almsgiving is the forgiveness of the people who are the children of the prince.
The purpose of the prince's leadership is to seek peace and development for the nation, to serve the people to live under the shadow of peace, prosperity and happiness. He once said that he did not intend to persecute anyone, but to keep the country at peace, law enforcement for the perpetrators was necessary.
Jayavarman VII also reigned, adhering to the Dharma and Brahma Vihara, treating the people as his descendants and giving alms to the descendants who should be forgiven, and this tradition was maintained until the Great King. Our current king is King Norodom Sihamoni, such as during the Water Festival, New Year, Birthday.
You say that amnesty under foreign pressure does not reflect the truth of Buddhist leadership, and you do not really understand the virtues of a Buddhist leader like Samdech Techo. .
Analysts should analyze on the basis of law, virtue, morality, reason, philosophy, tradition, etc., should not analyze just by using the word "I think" because the word "I think" may be thinking based on personal feelings, it does not There is enough value to aid the public perception, but if analyzed on the basis of law or ethics, etc., it is valuable to help the ideological base of our people.
Therefore, let all Cambodians believe in the leadership of Samdech Techo, be proud of the wisdom of Samdech, which has made this poor country peaceful and developed as it is today, and let all Cambodians participate in maintaining May this hard-won peace continue.
Phnom Penh, August 29, 2018 This morning, Samdech Techo Hun Sen continued to meet with more than 10,000 workers in Phnom Penh.
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on Wednesday, August 29, 2018, continued to meet with 14,799 workers. From 6 factories in Por Sen Chey district. The meeting took place in Trapeang Thleung village, Sangkat Choam Chao, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
Mr. Ith Sam Heng, Minister of Labor and Vocational Training, said that the six factories that allowed workers to meet with Samdech Techo Hun Sen this morning were four garment factories, one bag factory and one cardboard factory. 1. All products are exported to international markets and supplied to domestic markets.
The Minister of Labor and Vocational Training also pointed out that through these factories, these enterprises have created many jobs and additional jobs, making it easier for young people to find jobs in their localities, renting houses, selling food, transportation and services. Others contribute to the economic development and livelihood of local people.
Mr. Ith Sam Heng stated that Phnom Penh currently has a total of 4,453 factories, enterprises and establishments with 772,836 workers with a total salary of more than $ 1.855 million per year. There are 636 garment and footwear factories with 408,234 workers with a total salary of nearly $ 980 million per year.
It should be noted that Samdech Techo Hun Sen started to open a forum to talk with workers from factories, enterprises and establishments since Sunday, August 20, 2017. Today is the 55th meeting between Samdech Techo Hun Sen and workers. During the 55 meetings, a total of 766,339 workers met directly with Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen has emphasized that the visit to meet with the workers in order to understand the hardships of workers and solve their challenges. In particular, to promote better industrial policy 2015-2025.
Through a series of meetings, Samdech Techo Hun Sen has provided many benefits to workers and also harmonized in the garment and footwear industry.
