(Svay Rieng): On the afternoon of August 28, 2018, Ms. Ek Sovanphearak, Deputy Governor of Svay Rieng Province, led a technical inspection team to measure the container of container trucks and inspected the installation of two barricades to prevent trucks. Overweight traffic on the dirt road and paved road to the Krasaing Chrum border corridor in Svay Chrum district, which used to have scrap trucks driving on this road, causing damage to the road.
She said that as the provincial governor, as the chairman of the Provincial Unity Command, he never ignored the overweight trucks, always urged the professional officers to inspect regularly, and the province has set up a joint committee to inspect the vehicles. Overweight trucks have been seized through the cages in the past so that there will be no more overweight vehicles on the road.
