Officials at the Phnom Penh Municipal Court told Fresh News that the trial, which is set to begin in Tbong Khmum's Trapeang Phlong prison, was chaired by Trial Judge Ky Bithy and represented by Phnom Penh Municipal Court Deputy Prosecutor Sieng Sok. Separately, one of Kem Sokha's lawyers also confirmed that the four lawyers representing Kem Sokha will also be present at the prison hearing.
