The National Assembly announces the visit of the King as the High President to open the first session of the 6th National Assembly on September 5
(Phnom Penh): His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of Cambodia, will preside over the first session of the 6th National Assembly, which will take place at 8 am on September 5, 2018. This. This is according to the announcement of the General Secretariat of the National Assembly issued on August 27, 2018.
The Secretariat of the National Assembly confirmed that after the opening ceremony of the first session of the National Assembly, the first session of the sixth legislature will begin under the chairmanship of Samdech Ponhea Chakrei Heng Samrin, Senator of the National Assembly, to decide on the validity of each member's mandate and the adoption of internal regulations. Of the National Assembly of the 6th legislature.
