(Pailin): Prof. Tan Vuoch Chheng, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health, said that the leaders, civil servants and doctors of the Provincial Health Department must pay attention to cooperate with the National Nutrition Program and development partners to increase the number of love hospitals. Babies are available throughout the province, while so far Pailin has only one place.
Prof. Tan Vouch Chheng said this on August 27, 2018, together with Mr. Phan Chanthul, Governor of Pailin Province, in the declaration of recognition of the provincial hospital as a baby love hospital, and with the participation of all. Mr. and Mrs. Director of specialized departments around the province, local authorities, doctors, representatives of partner organizations and mothers in large numbers.
"Leaders, civil servants and doctors of the provincial health department must take care to cooperate with the national nutrition program and development partners to increase the number of infant love hospitals throughout the province," she said. So far, Pailin province has only one place.
Along with the implementation of the Love Baby Hospital, the provincial health department has also expanded the practice of the love baby community by training village chiefs and 41 village health support groups so that they can help mothers who have left the hospital as well as mothers. And caregivers in the community are educated to know good methods to practice healthy parenting.
