Currently, the Ministry has issued four prakas in addition to the four existing prakas related to the better and comprehensive implementation of the law on trade unions, a total of eight. In fact, as of 2017, the Ministry has registered 3,793 local unions, 138 trade unions, 23 unions and 8 employers' associations.
