In addition, within the framework of the labor inspection system reform, the Ministry has revised the checklist for labor inspection, including the Ministry's checklist and BFC checklist, and the preparation of guidelines for labor inspectors. Inspection through a single labor inspection system aims to improve the quality of labor inspectors of labor inspectors, as well as strengthen compliance with working conditions in accordance with the provisions of the law in force.
