The official stated that the technical team will take action in three stages, including: First, require the technical inspection team to fine the offending vehicle to pay the state budget, Second, to set the weight bar Properly avoid overloading, and the Technical Code of Vehicle Inspection must go to the beginning in Krol Ko commune, Svay Chrum district, near the border of Prey Veng and Svay Rieng, so that there will be no more cars on the road.
The official added that the provincial governor, on behalf of the Provincial Unity Command, has never been indifferent to overweight trucks, but has always urged professional officers to inspect regularly, and the province has set up a joint committee to inspect vehicles. Overweight trucks have been seized through the cages in the past so that there will be no more overweight vehicles on the road.
