(Siem Reap): The Ministry of Tourism, together with the Beijing International Chinese Language Institute, with the support of the Chinese Embassy in Cambodia and the Chinese Ministry of Commerce, organized a training course for 78 trainees on the Cambodia Tour Guide Trainer for China Tourism 2018.
After 16 days (August 8-24), the closing ceremony was presided over by Mr. Pak Sokhom, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Tourism, Minister Thong Khon and Mr. Liu Yunan, Assistant Director of the Beijing International Chinese Language Institute in Beijing. Angkor Century Hotel, Siem Reap Province on August 24, 2018.
He stated that under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, there is peace, stability and development, only in 2017, Cambodia received 5.6 million international tourists, an increase of 11.8. %. In the first six months of 2018, it received about 3 million international tourists, an increase of 13%. Cambodia expects to receive more than 7 million international tourists by 2020.
