Mr. Phouk Ratha said, "Today's inauguration demonstrates to another level that our mission is to provide secure and convenient payment services to our customers everywhere." Caste. ”
Mr. Phok Ratha added, "We strongly believe that DaraPay e-wallet will be able to provide many benefits to customers who use this service. "For direct customers, they will not have to carry cash or wait for a receipt from the seller."
In addition, for the trader, this new service will be able to reduce his workload in counting and storing cash registers. We are optimistic that DaraPay's eWallet will provide customers with the security they need to manage their cash flow and make their daily payment transactions easier and faster.
