Educate students directly on what researchers have seen so that students can keep up with the latest research trends, provide students with new and up-to-date information, and gradually pursue basic scientific research methods to train students, and students can learn on their own. To reduce the gap in understanding of the community because it is living in a heritage area.
"This educational program does not only focus on the temple, but also the environment, the underground, the aquatic and the intangible heritage, so that children know what is the heritage in their area," she said. How useful is it? And how to protect? Therefore, we need to train the next generation to do this work regularly and long-term care, because not only for the family, but the heritage for the whole nation.
