Mr. Khuong Sreng stated that establishing the use of this service will reduce the labor force, reduce the number of employees, and revenue management will not lose money. However, Mr. Khuong Sreng confirmed that this is not to accuse employees who have done this work in the past to lose or steal money because of modern technology that requires us to use this service.
In addition, Mr. Khuong Sreng also instructed Mr. An Sokhim to see the staff during the reduction to facilitate them to work somewhere by reporting to the Phnom Penh Capital Administration, that is, to ensure that they do not feel confused by this. It is a development step that requires the use of modern technology.
