Police crack down on 470 luxury timber trucks in Kratie province
(Kratie): Kratie Provincial Anti-Economic Crime Police cracked down on 470 luxury vehicles transporting luxury timber in Svay Chres commune, Snuol district, Kratie province, containing 25 pieces of heavy timber, handed over to the Forestry Administration for further action.
