Police said that the 470 truck carrying timber drove from the upper part of Kratie province to be sold in Vietnam, and residents reported that there was a case of timber transport and the economic crime police force followed the truck. At Svay Chres commune, he was arrested.
Currently, vehicles and timber are stored at Svay Chres Forestry Administration Sangkat for further measurement and management.
Dr. Sok Touch: Peace is the foundation of foreign policy relations
(Phnom Penh): Dr. Sok Touch, President of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, stated that peace is the foundation of foreign political relations in the whole world.
Dr. Sok Touch made this statement this morning, August 23, 2018, on the occasion of the Royal Academy of Cambodia's presentation on "US Foreign Policy Under Donald Trump's Administration and Its Meaning for Asia". Developed by the Cambodian Institute of International Relations of the Royal Academy of Cambodia.
Dr. Sok Touch said, "We must all think that there is no nation that cries without tears, and there is no nation without a smile, there must be a smile, and there is no nation." That does not need oxygen, all this requires peace. "Peace is the foundation of foreign political relations."
The reason why the President of the Royal Academy of Cambodia said this is because he sees that the world today is near the brink of war, while the trade war between the United States, Europe and Canada, especially with China, India, which are all giants. Asia is happening.
According to Sok Tuch, this action poses a great risk to the world economy, so the United States and those countries should resolve it peacefully in a win-win situation to avoid these risks for global prosperity.
Dr. Sok Touch also reminded that the First and Second Wars were all caused by trade disputes and now the world is moving in the same direction as in the past.
