According to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, on September 10, he will lead a delegation to attend the ASEAN-China Expo in Nanning, Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region, China. On September 12, Samdech will fly from China to attend the World Economic Forum in Hanoi, Vietnam.
On September 27, Samdech Techo Hun Sen will lead a delegation to New York to deliver a speech at the United Nations. In October, Samdech Techo will travel to Japan to attend the Mekong-Japan Forum, then fly to Bali, Indonesia to attend a meeting of heads of state and government with the International Monetary Fund.
On October 17, Samdech will fly from Cambodia to Brussels, Belgium to attend the Asia-Europe Meeting. On October 20, Samdech flew from Brussels to Ankara, Turkey to visit.
On October 22-25, Samdech will lead a delegation to Geneva, Switzerland to attend the trade forum. During his visit to the United States and Europe, Samdech Techo Hun Sen will also meet with people living there.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that after the end of Geneva, Switzerland, Samdech will hurry to return to the country to review and approve the budget law for 2019 in a timely manner.
