The meeting was held on the afternoon of August 22, 2018 at 4:00 pm at the Ministry of Economy and Finance to discuss the preparation of UNDP Cambodia Cooperation Program Document 2019-2023 with the goal of contributing To develop Cambodia with environment, sustainability, and innovation to achieve the goal of becoming Cambodia as a high middle income country by 2030.
According to a press release obtained by Fresh News this afternoon, Leang Su praised the Royal Government's efforts and congratulated Cambodia on its great achievements in achieving rapid development. And especially the success of achieving the Millennium Development Goals ahead of schedule.
Mr. Leang Sou also informed that UNDP is in the process of preparing the document of UNDP Cambodia Cooperation Program 2019-2023, which will be prepared in line with Vision 2050, Rectangular Strategy Phase 4 and National Development Strategic Plan. The new government.
Senior Minister Aun Porn Moniroth also briefed on the economic situation in Cambodia, which is achieving strong macroeconomic stability with high economic growth. Cambodia is actively moving towards the vision of 2050 to become a developed country, setting 2030 as the year to achieve the essential results of major reforms and transformation. Abroad, high middle income.
