He added that this special intervention training course was held only at the Cambodia-Vietnam Friendship Police School, at the Police Academy and in all six regions, and now has about four participants. , 000 people are studying both inside and outside the country.
Please be informed that Lt. Gen. Un On, Director of the Cambodia-Vietnam Friendship National Police School, said that for the special intervention training course, which is now 3 months long, there are 150 trainees from the Capital Police Commission. Provinces and 20 units under the General Commission of the National Police.
