Jolly Chic has grown in popularity in the Middle East and is the number one online retailer in the region, accounting for more than 80 percent of the total number of Internet users here.
The Chinese company entered the Middle East market three years ago. Reliable delivery system is an important factor for online retailers. Jolly Chic has decided to partner with Aramex, a well-known local shipping company, to ensure that its transportation network is stable and running smoothly, as well as creating business opportunities for the company.
Unlike other local and international online retailers, Jolichic offers the option of paying in cash on delivery and guaranteeing a refund in the event of a damage within a certain period of time. These principles protect the interests of customers and have helped the company to rapidly grow in popularity in the Middle East.
Jolly Chic opened a customer service center in Jordan. The center has more than 600 staff members, including 50 administrative staff and more than 500 customer service staff. They are all local employees.
