Immediately after receiving the information, the Kampong Svay district police immediately intervened by conducting a search. Police tracked down the buffalo legs that the thieves took from the house and found them taken into the house of Nuth Sothea, 43, and his wife Moeun Phally, 38, of Prey Tahou village, Prey Tahou commune, Stung Sen city. Kampong Thom Province.
