Mr. Lim Phal Varun confirmed that the representatives of each political party who participated in the discussion meeting all agreed and agreed with Samdech Techo Hun Sen to establish and name "Supreme Advisory Council".
The "Supreme Advisory Council" has its duties and mechanisms, including:
First: Meeting once a month by convening a meeting of the chairperson. Second: Meeting with the Prime Minister every six months or as necessary by the Prime Minister, held in the meantime as convened by the Prime Minister. This consultation will be completed in accordance with the mandate of the Royal Government.
The president of a political party participating in the "Supreme Advisory Council" shall be appointed with the rank of Senior Minister and the Vice President or Secretary General with the rank of Minister.
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chhim Phal Varun, Personal Adviser to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, said on August 21, 2018 that the composition of the "Supreme Advisory Council" will be selected from 16 political parties. Participated in the National Election for the 6th National Assembly in 2018, 2 people, the party president is called "the head of the delegation" and the vice president or secretary general of the party called "deputy chairman of the delegation".
Mr. Chhim Phalvarun said that the delegates to be selected as members of the "Supreme Council and Advisory Council" will be the head of the delegation to be nominated for the position of Senior Minister and the Deputy Chief of Delegation will be nominated for the position of Minister with the salary. As a national budget package in the Office of the Council of Ministers.
Speaking to the media after the talks, Mr. Chhim Phalvarun stated that "the composition is that each party sends its two delegates to the Supreme Council, usually the party president, party vice president or secretary general. . "But there may be some special cases where the party president can not be like that, the party can send a delegation, so we use the word delegate, a high-ranking official in the party, if not the president, then the vice president."
"And there are two delegates from each party, one is the head of the delegation with the rank of senior minister, the deputy head of the delegation has the rank of minister, and there will be a salary, which is the national budget package in the box office of the Council of Ministers," he said. .
According to the personal advisor to Samdech Techo Prime Minister, the participation in the composition of the "Supreme Council and Consultation" must be based on the principle of voluntariness. On the other hand, parties that want to join later are also allowed to join, but must first obtain the approval of the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia.
