List of 16 political parties that participated in the consultation with Samdech Techo Hun Sen at the Peace Palace this morning
(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, as the Prime Minister of Cambodia, this morning, August 21, 2018, met with the leaders of 16 political parties who participated in the election to consult on national construction and development. Better. This consultation took place at the Royal Government Palace.
