The victim is Pol Saram, 45 years old, a fishmonger living in Damnak Thom 3 Village, Sangkat Stung Meanchey 3, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh. The victim was born in Sangke Chong village, Kraing Svay commune, Preah Sdach district, Prey Veng province.
