(Phnom Penh): Floods in the next few days seem to be threatening the water of Stung Prek Tnaot again, which may lead to flooding in some areas in Dangkor district, Phnom Penh, after the heavy rains in Phnom district. Acute and Oral Mountains.
In fact, on August 20, 2018, Mr. Nuth Puth Dara, Governor of Dangkor District, together with the District Police Inspector, Khan Military Police Commander, Sangkat Chief, relevant village chiefs, Khan civil servants, inspected the water situation of Stung Prek Tnaot and were ready to take timely action. Various impacts caused by floods in collaboration with the Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology.
