The floodwaters caused the water to flow into Stung Prek Tnaot and Stung Slaku. In this regard, Mr. Lim Kanhor, Minister of Water Resources and Meteorology, has been managing the technical team to monitor carefully and be ready to prevent all Time because Stung Prek Tnaot can pour into Phnom Penh, while Stung Slakou pour into Takeo province, which must be monitored very carefully.
