(Phnom Penh): Raising and caring for children to follow the path of Dharma and be able to get a better education is the desire of every parent, no matter how much they have to sacrifice their strength, sweat, blood and fatigue. Many parents in the high school exam event (Bakdup) on the morning of August 20, 2018 went to stand at the examination centers to encourage their children, as well as to look forward to the results of their children. Also.
