For Ms. Theara is not worried about the results of her daughter's exam, because her daughter is strong enough, because she has not yet failed the exam, she can pass the scholarship exam at universities in the country and in China.
Ms. Theara said that having a daughter who excels in her studies is a blessing for her and also makes her very happy, sometimes wanting to show off. "Speaking of which, it's very happy and it's an honor to go and tell people that our children are so talented, our children are so talented," she said. It is an honor for me, for my family, as well as for my own children. ”
Raising a child following the path of good dharma and learning so well is not easy. What kind of experience and good tips does Ms. Theara have in educating her children?
