(Phnom Penh): On August 17, 2018, Mr. Sam Soeun, President of the Council of the National Union of Cambodia (CCNU), representing more than 70,000 workers in the garment and footwear sector, issued a letter of congratulations and full support. The results of the 6th National Assembly Election, which the National Election Committee (NEC) officially announced on August 15, 2018, the Cambodian People's Party won 125 of the 125 seats in the National Assembly.
The 6th National Assembly Election, which took place on July 29, 2018, is an election that is in accordance with the Constitution and the laws of the Kingdom of Cambodia, and is free, fair and just in a political environment of peace, neutrality and transparency. Made 83.02% of Cambodians on the voter list.
Once again, the Council of National Unions of Cambodia (CCNU) would like to solemnly declare its full support for the results of the 6th National Assembly election.
Phnom Kravanh Police Detain Suspect in Rape of Minor
(Pursat): The suspect, Keo Nonn, male, 63 years old, was arrested by the police of Phnom Kravanh District Police Inspectorate in connection with the case of rape of 2 minor victims. Angkor, Samrong commune, Phnom Kravanh district, Pursat province, at 10:05 on August 17, 2018, after receiving a complaint from the victim's family.
Lieutenant Colonel Tan Karith, Inspector of the Phnom Kravanh District Police Inspectorate, said that after receiving a complaint from the victim's family, the police arrived at the suspect's house and detained him and brought him to the Administrative Police Station for investigation. After the investigation, the police received the confession of the suspect, Keo Nonn, that he had indeed raped the two girls.
The inspector confirmed that the suspect, Keo Nonn, was the grandfather of the two victims and that the suspect was now in charge of building a case according to the procedure to be sent to the provincial court for legal action. Commander of the 5th Zone urges all officers to cooperate in internal unity and strive to comply with the orders of the Ministry of National Defense and ensure good border peace
