Kampong Chhnang Provincial Gendarmerie Chief Tells All Gendarmerie Forces to Continue Strengthening Security, Order and Prevent Local Crime
(Kampong Chhnang): Brigadier General Sak Sarang, Commander of the Kampong Chhnang Provincial Gendarmerie, told all the Gendarmerie to continue to strengthen security and public order and to prevent and suppress crimes in their localities. .
