The Prime Minister also revealed that he will provide an advisory role to the leaders of the unelected political parties in the ministries in which he specializes in providing opportunities to assist the Royal Government. Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that the new government of this mandate, Samdech wants to mobilize brain resources from everywhere to develop the nation.
