(Phnom Penh): The two groups of Samdech Preah Sangkareach, Samdech Preah Sangkhareach Tep Vong and Samdech Preah Sangkhareach Bour Kri, issued a joint petition announcing their full support for the results of the 6th National Assembly Election on the 29th. July 2018 and announced to support the candidacy of Samdech Techo Hun Sen as Prime Minister.
A joint petition received by Fresh News on the afternoon of August 16, 2018 stated, "At the same time, I would like to express my full support and solemn support for the process and results of "The 6th National Assembly election, which took place on July 29, 2018, was fair, just, democratic, free, multi-party and non-coercive."
