She added that bronchitis is divided into four different types, including stage 1, 2, 3 and 4, on the other hand to assess the first, second, third and third. 4 is based on measuring the patient's airway by letting the patient breathe out to know the force of the air, the doctor may know the stage of the patient.
Ms. Kao Suon Tuk said that the disease that kills the third person in the world is not an infectious disease because it is a chronic disease that occurs in people who like to smoke or other tobacco.
