Xi Jinping, secretary-general of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China, said in a congratulatory letter that he was pleased to hear that the CPP had won Cambodia's sixth parliamentary election on the 29th. July 2018 recently. On behalf of the Central Committee of the Communist Party of China and himself, I would like to extend a warm congratulations to Samdech Techo Hun Sen and the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party!
China is pleased to see that in recent years, under the right leadership of the Royal Government of Cambodia, led by Prime Minister Hun Sen, Cambodia has achieved political stability, rapid economic development, and the rise of international status. The Chinese side highly appreciates the continuous and fruitful achievements in all fields.
The Chinese side believes that the Cambodian People's Party will continue to unite and guide the Cambodian people to follow the development path that is appropriate to their country's situation, promote economic development, constantly improve people's living standards and increase national unity to make greater contributions. For the prosperity of the country and the happiness of the Cambodian people, as well as the stability and development of the region.
I wish Samdech good health, success in his work! I wish the friendship between China and Cambodia to last forever! In his congratulatory letter, Chinese Premier Li Keqiang wrote:
China and Cambodia are good neighbors and good partners. The Chinese side will continue to support Cambodia on the path of development that is in line with its national situation, and support Cambodia in safeguarding stability, accelerating development and improving people's lives.
We look forward to working with the Cambodian side to take the opportunity of the 60th anniversary of the establishment of diplomatic relations between China and Cambodia to push the comprehensive strategic partnership between the two countries to a new level, together building a meaningful common destiny community. Strategy. I wish Samdech good health and smooth work.
I wish the Kingdom of Cambodia prosperity and prosperity for the people. ”
