(Siem Reap): Yasodharapura Band is ready to perform their new classical music composition on Sunday evening, August 19, 2018 at the Heritage Center in Wat Reach Bo, Siem Reap for 1 hour. From 7 to 8 p.m. The performance of classical music, new songwriting by this group of Sothorapurak, the people can freely attend.
The leader of the Yasodharapura Band continued to announce the decision to name the classical band to create a new melody and the purpose of forming the group: "Because our group is in Siem Reap and want to name any based "From the identity of the place as the old people did in the past, so it was decided to call this band Yasodharapura, because this is the former location of the ancient capital."
