* Samdech Techo Hun Sen begins a talk with more than 10,000 workers in Sen Sok district.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that although the official results have not yet been announced, it is clear that the CPP is in the lead in managing seats in the National Assembly and leading the new government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is not accustomed to changing and betraying promises, so Samdech continues to meet with workers as promised before the election.
