* This morning's meeting, Samdech Techo Hun Sen also thanked the workers as well as people across the country who went to the polls more than 83 percent. Samdech Techo Hun Sen considered the people's turnout as a great success of the democratic process in Cambodia.
* The Prime Minister said that with the turnout of 83.02%, it was a huge failure of the former opposition party "sleep clean house" campaign.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed outrage that Sam Rainsy accused Samdech Techo of hiring assassins to kill him in France.
* Samdech Prime Minister said that if Samdech really wanted to kill Sam Rainsy, he would have killed him in Cambodia, but he would have died just by throwing bananas. Samdech Techo stated that Samdech never intended to kill any Cambodian, not even the Khmer Rouge leaders.
* The Prime Minister said that the results of the 2018 election are a demonstration of the maturity of the Cambodian people, especially this year's election did not worry people like the 2013 election.
* The Prime Minister stated that the development of Cambodia as it is now is not normal, there is a lot of effort from the leadership of the Royal Government and the Cambodian people as a whole.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen sent a message to Mr. Kong Vibol, Director General of Taxation, to consider the tax rate on the sale of land, not to follow the land price as before. In other words, Samdech wants to increase the stamp duty on land and houses, which is currently increasing in value.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the success of the election was not only the success of Samdech and the leaders of the CPP, but also the success of the Cambodian people and workers.
* At this point, Samdech Techo Hun Sen emphasized that the success of the Cambodian People's Party is to maintain peace, which is a necessary factor in maintaining employment for workers and people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that growth and investment cannot take place in war-torn countries such as the Middle East.
* The head of the Royal Government added that the people's going to the polls is to maintain a liberal, multi-party democracy and to go out to protect peace.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the value of peace that people choose through the 2018 election is the right choice.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on workers and people to work together to maintain peace, not to let anyone come to destroy this peace.
* The Prime Minister stated that the absence of peace, the absence of security, the order is a loss of development, investment and loss of income.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen revealed that the case of the workers who went on strike in Svay Rieng province, the story of the boss cutting wages because he went to the polls was to inspire information from the instigators, but in fact the boss did not cut it.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen requested Mr. Seng Teang to closely monitor the case of a person with triplets and to solve his shortage problem in a timely manner. Samdech's warning came after Samdech saw the complaint of the inability to raise the children of three twins in one family. Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that Samdech has donated 5 million Riels to the needy families.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has ordered Mr. Mam Bunheng, Minister of Health, to closely monitor the free medical treatment program for workers.
* Samdech Techo stated that in the new mandate, Samdech will be more active and drop more money into the health and education sectors to improve the well-being and knowledge of the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that so far the Royal Government has released 22 million US dollars to rescue workers,
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that stealing Samdech's Facebook was a national evil act. Samdech Techo expects that the anti-technology crime group will find the thief and bring him to justice.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called the hackers of his Facebook page and posted information about the distribution of seats to the Coalition for Democracy and FUNCINPEC, who intended to destroy the announcement of the election results.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen mentioned that the person who stole Samdech's Facebook was Sam Rainsy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech left the possibility for the French President to review the case in which Sam Rainsy accused Samdech of hiring people to kill him.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also mentioned the assassination of Dr. Kem Ley. Samdech said that Kem Ley's killer was the one who benefited the most from this killing. Samdech added that the Royal Government had no benefit from the killing.
* Samdech Techo stated that he knew the clues of the person who stole Samdech's Facebook, but Samdech left the police to work. Samdech Techo also thanked Facebook for its timely cooperation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he wanted to establish a consultation forum between the Royal Government and the parties that participated in the election.
* Samdech Techo stated that the establishment of this forum to provide opportunities for political parties to participate in the development of the country, especially to create a culture of dialogue between political parties in the National Assembly and political parties outside the National Assembly.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen further stated that the meeting was not held as the party president, but as the prime minister. Samdech confirmed that Samdech will make an invitation to the leaders of those political parties to meet on national affairs at the Royal Government Palace. According to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, this forum also provides an opportunity for non-parliamentary political parties to monitor the Royal Government's political program.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has announced that he will invite the leaders of political parties to serve as advisors or secretaries of state in various ministries to contribute to national development.
* Prime Minister Hun Sen stated that he wanted to meet with other party leaders who participated in the election before forming a new government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants to invite representatives of 20 political parties to give policy advice to the new Prime Minister to build the country
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that FUNCINPEC and the Khmer United National Party are using the money to run for office in the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen ended his speech with the workers at 9:35, thank you for watching live.
