The Secretary of State made the remarks while presiding over the Certificate Awarding Ceremony for Legal Representatives in the Application for Export-Import Documents (2nd and 3rd Generation) and opening a training course for legal representatives in Application for export-import documents (4th generation) held at the Ministry of Commerce on the morning of August 15, 2018.
