The Secretary of State congratulated the 114 trainees who successfully passed the second and third generation training courses, as well as the 64 trainees who were selected to attend the fourth generation training course, which will start on August 20. Until September 7, 2018.
In addition, Secretary of State Ok Bung also requested all participants to use the knowledge gained from the training to apply the work properly, especially to be responsible before the law of information and documents provided to the Ministry in accordance with the content. Prakas No. 258 of the Ministry of Commerce of the Kingdom of Cambodia
Through these training courses, the size of Cambodia's business has improved. In fact, the value of Cambodia's exports under the preferential trade system to foreign markets in 2017 amounted to 11.153 million US dollars, an increase of about 18% compared to 2016, which was only 9.421 million US dollars. .
