He continued that as the Vice President of the Party and the Director of the Cabinet of Samdech Krom Preah, he congratulated and respected all the decisions of Prince Norodom Ranariddh and also strongly believed that under the leadership of the Acting Chairman. This party will make FUNCINPEC have more support from the people.
Prince Norodom Chakravuth is now over 40 years old, the eldest son of King Norodom Ranariddh and Princess Mary Ranariddh. He is unmarried and holds a doctorate in engineering in France. Apart from that, he also had a great deal of knowledge about his father's political affairs.
The appointment of an acting chairman is expected to help attract young people to support FUNCINPEC, which has a majority of older members, as well as encourage young people to get involved in politics.
It should be noted that Samdech Krom Preah Norodom Ranariddh was seriously injured in a horrific traffic accident caused by a taxi overtaking another car and crashed into his procession in Prey Nob district, Sihanoukville province on the 17th. June 2018. The accident caused the death of Miss Ouk Phalla Ranariddh, along with several other passengers. As for Samdech Krom Preah, he has been sent abroad for treatment so far.
