This year's Sea Festival is held in Koh Kong Province! Ministry of Tourism and Provincial Administration Holds Meeting to Prepare for Sea Festival
(Koh Kong): After the 6th Sea Festival in Kep Province ended with great success, the Royal Government of Cambodia has designated Koh Kong Province as the next province to organize the 7th Sea Festival (for Koh Kong Province Round 2) That is why the Ministry of Tourism together with the Koh Kong Provincial Administration held the first meeting to determine the preparations for this big tourism festival with pomp.
The first meeting took place on August 14, 2018 at Koh Kong Provincial Hall, chaired by Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism and Ms. Mithona Phu Thong, Governor of Koh Kong Province, and attended by many relevant government officials.
Ms. Mithona Phu Thong mentioned the general situation and the work results that the provincial administration and its subordinates have achieved in the past, as well as some work directions for future implementation. At the same time, she confirmed some other work directions in preparation for the 7th Sea Festival, such as landscaping and improving some infrastructure.
After the Provincial Governor reported on the results of the work and the preparation of all professional skills of the province, Minister Thong Khon issued the following recommendations for implementation:
1. Develop tourism products and organize tour packages in the province by connecting tourist destinations with the ecotourism community, especially to have a beach to be a new tourism product for the province.
2. Strengthen the quality of industry and tourism services, especially accommodation, food, transportation and special tourist resorts, to promote the clean city race, clean resort, good service and good hospitality.
3. Organizing and improving the beauty, order, traffic order, hygiene, clean environment and decoration in cities and towns, especially inspiring people to participate and organize tourism.
4: Facilitating travel and accommodation of Cambodian and Thai people on Thai and Cambodian territory by enhancing good relations and cooperation between Cambodia and Thailand.
5. Preparation of programs and events during the three days of the Sea Festival, such as cultural performances, marches, water sports competitions, product and food exhibitions, tree planting, etc.
6: Establish an inter-ministerial working group to coordinate and process the Sea Festival and cooperate with provincial working groups.
The Minister confirmed that the Sea Festival in Koh Kong Province 2018, the Cambodian side will coordinate with the Thai side so that people and tourists can cross to visit each other.
As the number of tourists visiting Cambodia is increasing, the Minister expressed the expectation that during the three days of the 7th Sea Festival, national and international tourists will visit this tourism event from 25- 300,000 people.
More importantly, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen will preside over the second round of the 7th Sea Festival in Koh Kong province with local people and tourists. - International.
However, the problem of the road from Phnom Penh to Koh Kong province is also an important problem because because Cambodia is under the pressure of the weather, causing heavy rain, so the road is National Road 4. National No. 41, etc., is badly damaged and difficult to travel, so please call on the relevant authorities and institutions to resolve this issue in a timely manner.
Arrogant! Early in the morning, a house was demolished in Borey Sandepheap 2, Po Sen Chey district, and the villagers handed it over to the Khan police force.
(Phnom Penh): Residents of Borey Sandepheap 2 in Damnak Troyeung village, Sangkat Choam Chao 2, Khan Por Senchey, for a while now seem to be afraid of not being able to sell well because a group of thieves are breaking in, breaking into houses and stealing materials. There are some values as well.
