(Preah Vihear): Major General Chan Sopheaktra, Deputy Commander of the 4th Military Zone and Commander of the Preah Vihear Military Operation Area, told officers and soldiers standing along the Cambodian-Thai border in Choam Ksan District, Preah Vihear Province. Pay attention to effectively suppress all kinds of transnational crimes.
