(Battambang): Officials of Camcontrol Battambang Branch on August 11, 2018, in cooperation with officials of the Department of Commerce, Customs, Police and local authorities, inspected the checkpoint at O'Rumduol checkpoint, Phnom Proek district, intercepting mixed goods imported from the country. Nearly 300 kilograms of Thais were confiscated and immediately burned.
