He confirmed that the goods seized by the competent authorities were 200 kilograms of spoiled chicken, 60 kilograms of mixed quality cakes and 300 ml of chili sauce, out of date, which the traders had embedded in the fruit and vegetable carts imported through the stream. Rumduol, Phnom Proek district, on the Cambodian-Thai border.
