One of the reasons for the US to escalate the trade war, citing the phrase "American national security issues." In order to help trade activities, revitalize domestic industrial activities and to create more jobs for its people, the United States has taken a number of key measures, including raising tariffs on imports from China. But the results are beyond imagination.
In fact, the inclusion of $ 16 billion in Chinese imports is a clear example among other issues. Meanwhile, the US Trade Representative convened to decide whether to raise the import tax. A total of 82 delegates from the chemical, electronics and X-ray industries expressed their views.
