After inspecting the road in Stung Treng province, the Senior Minister inspected Road 377, which is the construction site of the 2250 m long road and the condition of Kampi Bridge, Sambok Commune, Chit Borei District, and distributed humanitarian donations to 50 flood victims. In Sandan commune, Sambo district.
Distribution of donations to flood victims and inspection of the condition of these roads and bridges to know the well-being of flood victims and to understand the actual situation of the impact that the Ministry is cooperating with the relevant authorities. To take preventive measures and plan to immediately repair the damaged site after the flood.
