Mr. Nakyoung Oh, Ambassador of the Republic of Korea, expressed his pleasure that the 23rd International Korean Speech Contest was held in Cambodia. He said that the program held in Cambodia today will help spread the Korean language more widely around the world, as well as become an aid in cultural development.
The Ambassador hopes that this program will be the key to cultural exchange between the Republic of Korea and Cambodia, as well as other countries in the world.
