(Svay Rieng): 1,400 workers of Seng Yao factory who went on strike to protest the Chinese boss cutting the money to go to the polls two days, until August 10, was coordinated by the provincial authorities and the Provincial Department of Labor and Vocational Training The settlement is complete, with the workers agreeing to return to normal work.
The meeting was chaired by Mr. Toch Poliva, Deputy Governor of Svay Rieng Province, Mr. Has Bunthy, Director of the Department of Labor and Vocational Training, Ms. Seng Yav, a representative of Seng Yav Company and workers 'representatives, as well as the authorities and the Federation of Khmer Aid Workers and the Federation of Workers' Rights. Khmer too.
Mr. Has Bunthy said that Seng Yao Enterprise Co., Ltd. has a total of 1,419 workers, 507 women. Workers strike to demand 15 conditions, including:
1: Ask the company not to fire workers without a clear reason.
2: Do not let the company violate the rules and regulations.
3: Ask the company to prepare the bathroom to be clean, have enough water and hand soap.
4: Ask the company to have enough medicine and doctors on duty at all hours.
5. Overtime is based on the principle of voluntary and non-coercive, based on the principles of labor law.
7: Ask the company to provide extra money for workers.
8: When workers ask for a law, ask the company to provide convenience to workers.
9: Do not allow companies to deduct workers' money on election day in accordance with the announcement of the Ministry of Labor.
10. When workers work for two months or more, ask the company to include full-time workers.
11. Pregnant workers with a medical certificate go to check for pregnancy one day a month and keep their wages and benefits.
12: Request the company to pay wages on the day of Samdech Techo Hun Sen program on May 29, 2018 (full workers have the right to use the end of the year workers to apply for business law).
13. The company should allow workers to use the annual leave when there is business.
14: Request the company to make a contract for full-time workers for 6 months.
15. During the strike, do not let the company cut workers' wages and other benefits and do not resent and fire any workers.
As a result, the company agreed to the workers' request for 15 points, but the company asked the workers not to continue the strike if there is a strike, the company does not provide wages and other benefits. Chroy Changvar district authorities raided a cockfighting arena, detaining 12 people, 37 motorcycles, a car and 7 roosters
