Mr. Kao Saravuth said that there were reports from nearby residents that there was a gambling place in Kien Khleang village, Chroy Changva commune. Immediately after receiving this news, Mr. Khleang Huot, the governor of Chroy Changvar district, ordered him to lead a joint force to crack down on the cockfighting location above.
(Phnom Penh): The fuel inspection team of the General Department of CamControl of the Ministry of Commerce through the mobile fuel laboratory vehicle led by Mr. Mean Chamnap, Deputy Director of the Department, this morning, August 10, 2018, in cooperation with professional officers of the Department. The experiment inspected the quantity and quality of fuel at a number of stations and depots located in Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
He said the operation was aimed at protecting the economic interests of consumers, protecting the machinery of all types of vehicles and protecting the environment arising from improper fuel consumption, and especially to prevent fraud.
According to the deputy director of the department, the quality and quantity control is based on on-site monitoring equipment, such as a caliper tank with a specific volume for measuring the amount of oil fired from the counter in different sizes, with a capacity of 5 liters, 10 liters and 20 L. The octane and cetan indexes are used in mobile laboratory vehicles.
As a result of checking the quality and quantity of fuel, 6 depots were found at the above location, 3 depots were in accordance with both quality and measurement, while 1 location was not quality compliant and 2 locations were not. Compliance in both quality and quantity.
He added that all vehicle users should consider in advance when choosing a gas station / depot, a company that trusts the use of new equipment, sells regular gasoline or soup and good quality diesel and all liters, check the counter number from Always zero before injection.
(Phnom Penh): General Nem Sovath, Director General of the General Department of Politics and Foreign Affairs and Chairman of the Working Group on Research and Construction of the Win-Win Monument, this morning, August 10, 2018, led a working group and relevant ministries to discuss. Establish achievements in the location of the Victory-Political Memorial and the end of the Cambodian civil war.
On that occasion, the Vice Chairman of the Win-Win Monument Construction Committee also urged all relevant institutions to continue more activities to help promote the work that has been worked hard so far to achieve what we planned.
The General also added that the Ministry of Institutions should prepare to participate in the exhibition on the 20th anniversary of the win-win policy of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and this celebration will take place on the 29th. December 2018 is coming.
Win-win politics is the policy of Samdech Techo Hun Sen to bring about national unity by bringing the Khmer Rouge army together under one roof, ending the flames of war and bringing complete peace to Cambodia since 1998. To this day. As for the Memorial Day of the Journey to the Overthrow of the Pol Pot Regime, it is a reminder of the sacrifices of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and other Cambodian dignitaries, as well as many other Cambodian fighters who fought to overthrow the Pol Pot regime.
General Nem Sovath considered the win-win policy and the struggle of Samdech Techo Hun Sen to end the flames of war, bring peace, as well as overthrow the Pol Pot regime as a historical fact that must be recognized and remembered. .
Please note that the construction of the Victory Monument began construction in February 2016 with an area of 8 hectares in Chroy Changva, Phnom Penh, a monument to the political victory and the end of the civil war in Cambodia. The budget used for construction is the contribution of the Royal Government, not related to the state budget. However, it did not specify how much the construction would cost.
Khmer people, the voters, came out to defend the ballot, called Sam Rainsy and took the oath of allegiance to Tai Hong
(Phnom Penh): The Cambodian people who participated in the election on July 29, 2018, were very angry with Sam Rainsy, who accused the voter turnout of 82.89% as inflated by the commission. National Election. The voters considered Sam Rainsy's remarks as an insult to their will and asked the fugitive to swear allegiance to Tai Hong.
The reaction of the Cambodian people, who are the voters, came after Mr. Sam Rainsy once and twice continued to attack and accuse the largest number of voters in the history of the election in Cambodia up to 82.89 percent that is an inaccurate number and inflated by the National Election Committee.
Another voter living in Phnom Penh expressed outrage at Sam Rainsy's remarks. Mr. Merman considered Sam Rainsy's remarks an insult to his will and vote.
"This statement by the cowardly inmate is a serious insult to the will of the Cambodian people who went to the polls," he said. We go to the polls, but our vote, our vote, is inflated, organized, it is a serious insult. "As a voter, I do not agree with this."
The voter, who lives in Phnom Penh, was not only outraged by allegations that the vote was rigged, he also defended his will and the ballot, calling inmate Sam Rainsy to swear his life. Death of wife, children and relatives. Mr. Merman also expects Mr. Rainsy to dare to take the oath if Sam Rainsy thinks the oath is just a superstition.
Regarding the oath of allegiance to protect the ballot, Mr. Dara, a resident of Phnom Penh on the outskirts of Dangkor district, said that the oath was not a dead end, as Sam Rainsy said.
He said that in Cambodian society, swearing was a sacred thing, and in 2013, Sam Rainsy's group had sworn in front of Angkor Wat that they would not betray the will of their supporters. Absolutely did not recognize the election results and enter the National Assembly, but in the end they recognized the election results, walked into the National Assembly and punished the sacred objects in the former capital of Angkor immediately imposed sanctions.
Mr. Dara also said that if Mr. Sam Rainsy does not believe in the oath and is not afraid of suffering like the 2013 oath, he would like to invite Mr. Sam Rainsy to come out and swear with him, putting Tai Hong to death, leaving his family and relatives. Also.
