He added that in order to make local films more popular, the Ministry of Culture always organizes many special courses to share knowledge as well as train skills on those who do not know and know more to be able to easily film with foreigners. Come shoot in Cambodia.
He added that it is clear that the influx of foreign films is sure to have an impact on Cambodian films. But in terms of cost, foreign films imported into Cambodia are cheaper than self-produced, while the quality of Cambodia is still limited. However, the ministry will try to double the quality of training.
