Mr. Pan Sosak, Minister of Commerce, stated that in the first half of 2018, Cambodia exported 4.143 million US dollars worth of garments, an increase of 11%, while agricultural products amounted to 272 million US dollars, an increase of 8%. $ 1.379 billion, up 14 percent from the same period in 2018.
